name: Deja Vu — red seal
author: corpus
description: >-
  Deja Vu adds a Red Seal to 1 selected card. First-shop spectral retrigger engine: pair
  with high-value cards, Glass Joker, Seltzer, and Dusk.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - spectralCard: DejaVu
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: GlassJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Dusk
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
